---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="SARA | BASPLib">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
        <header>
            <a href="/SARA_family" class="text-sm font-bold text-[#6E898A] hover:text-[#CF9E5F] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 w-fit">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
                Back to SARA
            </a>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter mb-4 inline-block pr-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#292350] via-[#432E60] to-[#CF9E5F] bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                SARA
            </h1>
            <h2 class="text-sm md:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#6E898A] opacity-80 italic border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
                Sparsity Averaging Reweighted Analysis
            </h2>
        </header>

        <section>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#2F3E5E] mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
                Main codes
            </h3>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <a href="https://basp-group.github.io/Faceted-HyperSARA" target="_blank" class="block bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-[#CF9E5F]/50 transition-all duration-300 group">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-[#292350] mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100 group-hover:text-[#CF9E5F] transition-colors">SARA RI V1.0</h4>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                        <img src="/images/logo/GitHub-logo2.png" alt="GitHub Logo" class="h-8 w-auto object-contain" />
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#2F3E5E] mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
                Papers & Codes
            </h3>
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <article class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
                        <strong class="text-[#292350] block mb-1">Parallel faceted imaging in radio interferometry via proximal splitting (Faceted HyperSARA): I. Algorithm and simulations</strong>
                        P.-A. Thouvenin, A. Abdulaziz, A. Dabbech, A. Repetti, and Y. Wiaux,<br>
                        <i class="text-[#6E898A]">MNRAS</i>, 521(1):1-19, 2023.<br>
                        <a href="http://arxiv.org/abs/2003.07358" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">ArXiv:2003.07358</a> |
                        <a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/mnras/stac1521" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">DOI:10.1093/mnras/stac1521</a>
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#292350]/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
                        <a href="https://basp-group.github.io/Faceted-HyperSARA" target="_blank" class="hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <img src="/images/logo/GitHub-logo2.png" alt="GitHub Logo" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
                        <strong class="text-[#292350] block mb-1">Cygnus A super-resolved via convex optimization from VLA data</strong>
                        A. Dabbech, A. Onose, A. Abdulaziz, R. A. Perley, O. M. Smirnov, Y. Wiaux,<br>
                        <i class="text-[#6E898A]">MNRAS</i>, 476(3):2853-2866, 2018.<br>
                        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.08810" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">ArXiv:1710.08810</a> |
                        <a href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/mnras/sty372" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">DOI:10.1093/mnras/sty372</a>
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#292350]/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
                        <a href="https://github.com/basp-group/SARA-adaptive-PPD" target="_blank" class="hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <img src="/images/logo/GitHub-logo2.png" alt="GitHub Logo" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
                        <strong class="text-[#292350] block mb-1">A Fourier dimensionality reduction model for big data interferometric imaging</strong>
                        S. V. Kartik, R. E. Carrillo, J.-P. Thiran and Y. Wiaux,<br>
                        <i class="text-[#6E898A]">MNRAS</i>, 468(2):2382–2400, 2017.<br>
                        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.02097" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">ArXiv:1609.02097</a> |
                        <a href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/mnras/stx531" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">DOI:10.1093/mnras/stx531</a>
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#292350]/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
                        <a href="https://basp-group.github.io/SARA-dimensionality-reduction" target="_blank" class="hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <img src="/images/logo/GitHub-logo2.png" alt="GitHub Logo" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-2">
                        <strong class="text-[#292350] block mb-1">The w-effect in interferometric imaging: from a fast sparse measurement operator to superresolution</strong>
                        A. Dabbech, L. Wolz, L. Pratley, J. D. McEwen and Y. Wiaux,<br>
                        <i class="text-[#6E898A]">MNRAS</i>, 471(4):4300-4313, 2017.<br>
                        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.05009" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">ArXiv:1702.05009</a> |
                        <a href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/mnras/stx1775" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">DOI:10.1093/mnras/stx1775</a>
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
                        <strong class="text-[#292350] block mb-1">An accelerated splitting algorithm for radio-interferometric imaging: when natural and uniform weighting meet</strong>
                        A. Onose, A. Dabbech and Y. Wiaux,<br>
                        <i class="text-[#6E898A]">MNRAS</i>, 469(1):938-949, 2017.<br>
                        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1701.01748" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">ArXiv:1701.01748</a> |
                        <a href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/mnras/stx755" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">DOI:10.1093/mnras/stx755</a>
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#292350]/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
                        <a href="https://github.com/basp-group/SARA-PPD" target="_blank" class="hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <img src="/images/logo/GitHub-logo2.png" alt="GitHub Logo" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
                        <strong class="text-[#292350] block mb-1">Scalable splitting algorithms for big-data interferometric imaging in the SKA era</strong>
                        A. Onose, R. E. Carrillo, A. Repetti, J. D. McEwen, J.-P. Thiran, J.-C. Pesquet, and Y. Wiaux,<br>
                        <i class="text-[#6E898A]">MNRAS</i>, 462(4):4314-4335, 2016.<br>
                        <a href="http://arxiv.org/abs/1601.04026" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">ArXiv:1601.04026</a> |
                        <a href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/mnras/stw1859" target="_blank" class="text-[#CF9E5F] hover:underline font-medium">DOI:10.1093/mnras/stw1859</a>
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#292350]/5 p-4 rounded-xl">
                        <a href="https://github.com/basp-group/SARA-primaldual/" target="_blank" class="hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <img src="/images/logo/GitHub-logo2.png" alt="GitHub Logo" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>